<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia treasury raises 83 mln dinars at auction.</title>
<headline>Tunisia treasury raises 83 mln dinars at auction.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunisian Treasury raised 83 million dinars at its weekly auction of treasury bills dated April 22, and repaid maturing paper totalling 17.8 million dinars.</p>
<p>Breakdown of auction results:</p>
<p>    Maturity			 Amount   Rate    Previous week</p>
<p>    Two-year note payable in   25 MD    6.9375   20 MD  6.8750</p>
<p>    equal annual tranches	58 MD    7.0000   20 MD  6.9375</p>
<p>								12.4MD  7.0000</p>
<p>Banks bid for 209 million dinars for two-year notes at between 6.9375 and 7.2500 percent.</p>
<p>($1=1.08 dinar)</p>
<p>--Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
